# EscrowFlow

- **Product:** Milestone escrow—ERC20 deposits, deliverables, approvals/releases, disputes/arbitration, notifications, dashboards, tx history, IPFS (agreements, deliverables, evidence), on-chain event sync.
- **Stack:** Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Prisma, PostgreSQL, wagmi + viem, SIWE-style auth, Solidity + Hardhat + OpenZeppelin, IPFS, EVM.
- **Quality:** Modular layout, strong types, validation, solid errors, responsive UI with loading/empty/success/error states, tests (contracts, API, UI), docs where helpful.
- **Process:** Extend the **existing** codebase incrementally; do **not** rewrite from scratch; preserve behavior unless explicitly changing it.

Full narrative and details: **AGENTS.md** (keep it updated when product/stack direction changes).
